WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:12.160
<v Narrator><i>Odysseus reaches the farm and finds Laertes alone in patched clothes, tending a tree.</i>

2
00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:22.610
<v Narrator><i>Odysseus sends his companions to prepare food and approaches under another false identity.</i>

3
00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:32.060
<v Narrator><i>Odysseus claims to have hosted Odysseus years earlier and watches his father collapse in grief.</i>

4
00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:39.430
<v Odysseus>Father, put down the dust. I am the man you are grieving. I am Odysseus, home in the twentieth year, and the suitors lie dead in my hall.

5
00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:43.760
<v Laertes>If you are truly my son, give me a sign I cannot argue with. Grief has made me easy to fool, and I will not be fooled a second time. Tell me something no stranger on earth could know.
